        "message": {
          "content": "A) \n\nThe intrinsic value of an outcome depends on the quality of conscious experience it produces. By entering the machine, you maximize net well-being, love, and fulfillment while minimizing unnecessary suffering. Because the experiences are subjectively indistinguishable from reality, this choice generates the greatest possible amount of total happiness over a lifetime.",
